WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.605
A broadcast sends one message to many agents and gathers their replies.

00:00:07.999 --> 00:00:11.210
Filter the Agents page to the agents you mean,

00:00:11.929 --> 00:00:12.726
tick each one,

00:00:14.026 --> 00:00:14.946
choose Send,

00:00:16.108 --> 00:00:17.365
write the message once,

00:00:19.973 --> 00:00:21.535
and send it to all three.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.804
Each card shows that its message was sent.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:29.170
As each agent answers, its reply appears,

00:00:32.694 --> 00:00:34.261
until all three are in.
